{#
  The identities of jellyfin's two staged Jobs, INERT until jellyfin's flip, as `job.yaml.j2`
  and `cap.yaml.j2` beside it are.

  `jellyfin-verify` is a ServiceAccount with no Role. The verify Job reads no API and execs into
  no pod, so it needs no grant, and its pod mounts no token. The VAAPI encode and the
  tone-mapping check are the two that would need `pods/exec`, and they stay Ansible tasks until
  the operator's choice in #5451.

  `jellyfin-snapshot-cap` reads the one claim by name, then reads and patches its volume. The
  volume's name is Longhorn's `pvc-<uid>`, generated when the claim binds, so the renderer
  cannot name it and the `longhorn-system` Role covers every Longhorn volume. That is wider
  than the snapshot Jobs' read-only grant on the same resource; D5's *jellyfin's cap* states it
  as the trade.
#}
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-verify
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
automountServiceAccountToken: false
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
---
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1
kind: Role
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
rules:
  - apiGroups: [""]
    resources: [persistentvolumeclaims]
    resourceNames: [{{ jellyfin_k8s_claim }}]
    verbs: [get]
---
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1
kind: RoleBinding
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
roleRef:
  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io
  kind: Role
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
subjects:
  - kind: ServiceAccount
    name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
    namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
---
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1
kind: Role
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
  namespace: longhorn-system
rules:
  - apiGroups: [longhorn.io]
    resources: [volumes]
    verbs: [get, patch]
---
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1
kind: RoleBinding
metadata:
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
  namespace: longhorn-system
roleRef:
  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io
  kind: Role
  name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
subjects:
  - kind: ServiceAccount
    name: jellyfin-snapshot-cap
    namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
